    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[1].dialogueLine
      value: No me suena de nada este lugar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[2].dialogueLine
      value: "\xBFYara tienes informaci\xF3n de este lugar?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[3].dialogueLine
      value: "Buscando informaci\xF3n de este lugar en la base de datos..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[4].dialogueLine
      value: "No se obtuvo informaci\xF3n alguna se\xF1orita Anna."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[5].dialogueLine
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[6].dialogueLine
      value: "Rayos la nave esta totalmente destruida \xBFSe puede iniciar la auto-reparaci\xF3n
        Yara?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[7].dialogueLine
      value: Calculando...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[8].dialogueLine
      value: "Lo lamento se\xF1orita Anna pero no es posible hacer eso."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[9].dialogueLine
      value: Faltan varias piezas, componentes y estructura para hacer eso.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[10].dialogueLine
      value: "Creo que lo m\xE1s logico en este momento es empezar a avanzar para
        pedir ayuda."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4839105773005779062, guid: 506240635e7c4bc4490f95f2776e0744, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[11].dialogueLine
      value: "Concuerdo con usted se\xF1orita Anna."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
